<title>UK: Adscene to keep commercial printing division.</title>
<headline>Adscene to keep commercial printing division.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British regional newspaper publisher Adscene Group Plc said on Wednesday that talks on the sale of its commercial printing division had concluded and the division would remain with the group.</p>
<p>The company had revealed in February that an approach to buy the division was made.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
